===Look for spare parts for the mine cart{{subst:void|<!--101050124-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Great Mine|update|The crisis in the mines is no more, and most of the Wildfire members have left the spot, escorting miners to safety along with them.<br />However, Seele has not yet brought her captive, Bronya, to the chief, and you haven't had the chance to meet this important figure, a meeting with whom is the biggest motive behind this journey.<br />And yet, the way forward is cut off by a mine cart out of order.<br />"Bang, bang!" You can't help but picture Mr. Yang destroying the cart with his black hole.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
