;(Talk to Oleg)
:'''Oleg:''' Ah, young {{MC|ж=lady|м=man}}. This isn't the best place for a chat. Let's keep things brief.
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What's so great about Svarog?
::'''Oleg:''' Svarog? He's an artificially intelligent being from the Old World. He was here when the underground was first constructed. That's about all I know.
::'''Oleg:''' Now he guards the Furnace Core hub. Many vagrants have established bases in the vicinity, seeking Svarog's protection.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What happened in the mine?
::'''Oleg:''' You got the gist from Natasha, right? The miners and vagrants came to blows over the vein, then Svarog's subordinates pushed everyone back.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Just pushed them back?
:::'''Oleg:''' Well, perhaps their methods were lacking in finesse, but that's essentially what they did.
:::'''Oleg:''' If you want my take, he prevented another Underworld conflict, even if the execution was rough around the edges.
:::'''Oleg:''' His behavior says something about his thinking: "As long as everyone's been driven out, the conflict is over."
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So Svarog wasn't after the vein?
:::'''Oleg:''' You saw for yourself &mdash; after he pushed everyone back, he disappeared. It was clear: He didn't have any interest in the vein itself.
:::'''Oleg:''' If you want my take, he prevented another Underworld conflict, even if the execution was rough around the edges.
:::'''Oleg:''' His behavior says something about his thinking: "As long as everyone's been driven out, the conflict is over."
::;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What do you want to say to Bronya?
::'''Oleg:''' Well, I heard that she's a Silvermane Guard that was sent to arrest you. I expected you to be less friendly around each other... Are you worried about her?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We're working together now.
:::'''Oleg:''' Oh, working together? Understood. Rest easy, I won't make things difficult for her.
:::'''Oleg:''' We haven't seen a Silvermane Guard down here for a long time now. I just wanna ask her a few questions, nothing more.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Don't threaten her.
:::'''Oleg:''' Hahahaha, you needn't worry! That Silvermane girl wouldn't be afraid of an old veteran anyway.
:::'''Oleg:''' We haven't seen a Silvermane Guard down here for a long time now. I just wanna ask her a few questions, nothing more.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Very much so.
:::'''Oleg:''' Really? I'm surprised. Still, you can rest easy, I won't make things difficult for her.
:::'''Oleg:''' We haven't seen a Silvermane Guard down here for a long time now. I just wanna ask her a few questions, nothing more.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I've nothing to ask.
::'''Oleg:''' It's getting late. You should go back to the town and get some rest.

;(Talk to Natasha)
:'''Natasha:''' Oh, it's you... It looks like the conflict is over for now. Thank goodness, if the numbers of wounded had kept climbing, I don't know what we'd have done. If only he'd have been here...
:'''Natasha:''' ...Now's not the time for those thoughts. I need to focus on treating the injured.
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Can I help you with anything?
::'''Natasha:''' You've done enough. Treating the injured is doctor's work.
::'''Natasha:''' So if you're not hurt yourself, you should go back and get some rest. Relax, if I need your assistance, I won't hesitate to ask.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} And who is "he?"
::'''Natasha:''' ...Could you pretend like you didn't hear anything? Now's not the time.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Thank you, doctor.
::'''Natasha:''' The same to you and your friends. You've just arrived and already helped resolve such a sizable conflict. I don't know how to thank you.
::'''Natasha:''' You'd best get some rest back in town.
{{Dialogue End}}

===Search for mine cart parts with the help of the Home-Use Object Finder{{subst:void|<!--101050125-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Great Mine|update|The crisis in the mines is no more, and most of the Wildfire members have left the spot, escorting miners to safety along with them.<br />However, Seele has not yet brought her captive, Bronya, to the chief, and you haven't had the chance to meet this important figure, a meeting with whom is the biggest motive behind this journey.<br />And yet, the way forward is cut off by a mine cart out of order.<br />Luckily, you happen to have picked up a Findie, a product from the Interastral Peace Corporation with the purpose of searching for things. Someone must have left behind in the mines. Maybe it can lead you to the parts required to fix the mine cart...}}
{{Dialogue Start}}


